briefing =
    Captain Nabil Haidar, coast guard. Tonight the navigation lights along this reef coast lied. Spoofed signals steered the fishing fleet onto the reef line, and three groups of survivors are stranded on the beaches east of town.
    
    You have a small mobile force and no base. Find all three groups, then bring their transports back along the coast road to the town clinic. Orion Group patrols are already closing in from the north, and their columns will strike the watch post and then the town. The third group pulled someone out of the sea, a stranger nobody can explain.
    
    If the clinic falls or your force is lost, the operation fails.
